<title>POLAND: POLFA JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLFA JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.23 vs   1.82</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.42 vs   2.95</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.68 vs   2.70</p>
<p> Sales		   13.68 vs  12.15</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.76 vs  10.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.93 vs  17.55</p>
<p> Operating profit    18.15 vs  17.39</p>
<p> Sales		  121.98 vs  98.74</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish drug maker is Polfa Kutno SA</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
